*(Optional later: `STRIPE_SECRET_KEY`, `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET`, `DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN`, `DISCORD_GUILD_ID`, `DISCORD_CLIENT_SECRET`)*

6. Click **Deploy**. 
7. Confirm the server is running by visiting the health check: `https://yoloscripts.onrender.com/api/health`

